    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Stephen Bayliss",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "My thoughts on implementing this are:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "content": [
           {
            "content": [
             {
              "text": "Existing FOXML validation on ingest (and when committing object if in DEBUG):",
              "type": "text"
             }
            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
           },
           {
            "content": [
             {
              "content": [
               {
                "content": [
                 {
                  "text": "improve configuration options to select which validation (XSD and/or Schematron) get run at each point (ingest, commit to object store)",
                  "type": "text"
                 }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
               }
              ],
              "type": "listItem"
             }
            ],
            "type": "bulletList"
           }
          ],
          "type": "listItem"
         },
         {
          "content": [
           {
            "content": [
             {
              "text": "New DigitalObject-based validation - new module (configure via spring) to hook into new interface DOObjectValidator in current doCommit() - this for instance (with some fairly minor code changes) will allow the ECM validator to be plugged in to validate on ingest (as configuration option, of course!).",
              "type": "text"
             }
            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
           }
          ],
          "type": "listItem"
         }
        ],
        "type": "bulletList"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "As part of this tackle the current Schematron validation lack of caching the prepared stylesheet - for which there probably should be a different issue.  Tests showing this can range from 20% to 50% of DefaultManagement.ingest time",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
